  "content": "\n\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qjonte2.png\" alt=\"Formations Overworld 橫幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"797\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Formations Overworld</strong> 為主世界各生態域增添了許多新結構！</h3>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yl2Gq3d.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>結構</strong></h4>\n<h5>以下是您可以在 Formations Overworld 中找到的部分結構範例。如需更多圖片，請瀏覽圖片庫。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/697/310/172/bamboo_hut.png\" alt=\"叢林中的竹屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/712/310/172/tower_remnant.png\" alt=\"古老塔樓的殘蹟\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/714/310/172/desert_houses.png\" alt=\"沙漠中的小屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/722/310/172/wagon.png\" alt=\"被雪覆蓋的馬車\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ksGhYpe.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>常見問題</strong></h4>\n<h5><strong>我可以將您的模組加入我的模組包（modpack）中嗎？</strong></h5>\n<h5>是的，歡迎將我的模組用於您的模組包中。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TNtFe30.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4>\n<h5>欲了解未來內容、即將推出的模組及參與討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"加入 Discord 按鈕\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iLGGqDH.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tsJvc9x.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/M8GKFFk.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>",
